   "id": 674159,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Nordstrom’s reputation was built upon its value proposition of superior service. The company has maintained a high level of service over the years. Research other retailers that have a similar service-oriented value proposition. It could be a car company, restaurant, clothing store, etc. In looking at the changing demographics, do you believe that this level of service will continue to be perceived as value? If not, what will take its place?",
